.model PINCLAMP D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
VPSU psu 0 PWL(0 0 1u 5.0 40m 5.0 40.001m 7.0)
RPATH psu in 0.07256813609744617
CIN in 0 1u
XTVS in 0 TVS
RTOP in ovlo 604603.9999999999
